Get ready for the all-new KWSP i-Akaun app, designed to provide you with a seamless and user-friendly experience. 



While our existing i-Akaun app has served us well, we would like to introduce our members to the new KWSP i-Akaun app. This upgraded platform provides a range of tools to support you in optimising your retirement savings. Easily access and utilise your favourite features from the existing i-Akaun version, now with added convenience and new features. Stay in control of your retirement savings effortlessly and make the most of these features at your fingertips:

• Register as an EPF member and activate your i-Akaun instantly;
• Boost your savings with Voluntary Contribution;
• Easily manage your nomination registration and updates;
• View and download Accounts statements, check on contributions and more; 
• Define your financial future with the retirement calculator; 
• Secure your loved ones’ future, even in your absence, through i-Sayang;
• Gain the flexibility to cancel withdrawal requests at your convenience;
• Protect yourself with affordable healthcare and life insurance/takaful;
• Check your withdrawal eligibility, apply for withdrawals and view your past withdrawal transactions for members aged 50 years and above; and 
• Get important updates and tips from EPF, so you can stay informed about the latest opportunities to maximise your savings. 


From monitoring your account activities and taking charge of your retirement savings to locating our nearest branch, everything is on the app, at your fingertips. 



So why wait? Download the new KWSP i-Akaun app now and embark on a journey of maximising your savings potential with confidence and ease! 

We would like to inform our valued members that the current i-Akaun app will be phased out and ultimately discontinued.

